Package: multds
Title: Class Prediction for High-Dimensional Class-Imbalanced Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("fossil contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "fossil@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: The classifiers, class-imbalance corrections (over-sampling, down-sizing and
    multiple down-sizing, MultDS) and evaluation of Blagus and Lusa (2010),
    <doi:10.1186/1471-2105-11-523>, rebuilt from the paper's text: two-sample t-test variable
    selection on the training set, nine classifiers (1-, 3- and 5-NN, DLDA, DQDA, random forest,
    linear SVM, PAM and penalized logistic regression), the predictive accuracies, predictive values
    and AUC, and the paper's simulation design.
